  "prefLabel": "Fis 1102.09 Moose Permits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1102.09 Moose Permits.\n\n(a) The fee for a resident moose permit shall be $150.\n\n(b) The fee for a non-resident moose permit shall be $500.\n\n(c) Moose permits shall be signed by both the permittee and subpermittee.\n\nSource. #7289, eff 6-1-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 1100) renumbered by #8183 (formerly Fis 1102.21); ss by #8914, eff 1-1-08; ss by #9800-A, eff 1-1-11; ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18",
